-- Nesting deeper than the physical register bank. Each activation past the
-- sixteenth wraps onto an occupied register and saves its occupant on the
-- spill stack, so no live intermediate is lost.
Commit(plus(1, plus(2, plus(3, plus(4, plus(5, plus(6, plus(7, plus(8, plus(9, plus(10, plus(11, plus(12, plus(13, plus(14, plus(15, plus(16, plus(17, plus(18, plus(19, plus(20, plus(21, plus(22, plus(23, 24))))))))))))))))))))))))
